  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b35019a955b4c3c49b8eea6f9e439ec9, type: 3}
  m_Name: PolandQuestion21
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HowX.Data.QuestionData
  text:
    en: You are at a party. Someone yells "Bitter, bitter!". What happens?
    native: "Jeste\u015B na weselu. Kto\u015B krzyczy \"Gorzko, gorzko!\". Co si\u0119
      dzieje?"
  visual: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7c691013b6321eb4386f53a682bb19a5, type: 3}
  useImageAnswers: 0
  answers:
  - text:
      en: The vodka is bad
      native: "W\xF3dka jest niedobra"
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: The Bride and Groom must kiss
      native: "Para M\u0142oda musi si\u0119 ca\u0142owa\u0107"
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 1
  - text:
      en: A fight starts
      native: "Zaczyna si\u0119 b\xF3jka"
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: Everyone leaves
      native: "Wszyscy wychodz\u0105"
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  explanation:
    en: The vodka is 'bitter', so the couple must sweeten it with a kiss. If they
      stop kissing, people keep yelling.
    native: "W\xF3dka jest 'gorzka', wi\u0119c para musi j\u0105 os\u0142odzi\u0107
      poca\u0142unkiem. Je\u015Bli przestan\u0105, ludzie krzycz\u0105 dalej."
